      "title": {
        "en": "Agent Extension",
        "zh-cn": "智能体扩展"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Manage agent extensions in DSH — plugin marketplaces, install/update/rollback, per-item capability toggles, and built-in cross-session memory v2 (global + project scopes, model-written facts with session-end fallback capture, layered recall index, maintenance runs).",
        "zh-cn": "在 DSH 里管理智能体扩展：插件市场与逐项启停，并内置跨会话记忆 v2（全局 + 项目双作用域、模型主动写入与会话末补漏、分层索引召回、维护整理）。"
      },
